      {
        "h_title": "Central Hua Hin: Away from the beach",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Hua Hin",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "The area west of Phetkasem in the centre of Hua Hin includes a mix of budget spots to go with a few midrange hotels close to the night market. Quieter than the Nares Damri neighbourhood (a five-minute walk away), this area is convenient if you’re arriving late on a train or bus from Bangkok. Some of the cheapest digs in town can be scored around here.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "My Place @ Hua Hin",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Hua Hin",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "In an area stacked with bland hotels, My Place @ Hua Hin stands out thanks to its sharp crimson-and-grey colour scheme and goldfish pond out front. Step into the sleek lobby and the tasteful Chinese-inspired art, glossy floors and bubbling fountain all make it clear that this place is classier than the rest. You pay a bit more for the added style, but it might be worth it. Available in a... Read our full review of My Place @ Hua Hin including room rates and direct contact details.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/prachuap_khiri_khan/hua_hin/all/6569",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/prachuap_khiri_khan/hua_hin/all/6569",
                "anchor_text": "... Read our full review of My Place @ Hua Hin including room rates and direct contact details."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "My Place @ Hua Hin",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/prachuap_khiri_khan/hua_hin/all/6569",
