                "anchor_text": "My Place @ Hua Hin"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Nid Huahin Hotel",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Hua Hin",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Nid Huahin Hotel (previously Hua Hin House) may not have a creative name or stylish design, but it gets the job done for those seeking a solid room at an affordable price. One of a few places to stay down a side lane that branches off of Soi 74, the small hotel has a dated feel in the lobby, where the included continental breakfast is served and a small food menu is offered throughout the... Read our full review of Nid Huahin Hotel including room rates and direct contact details.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/prachuap_khiri_khan/hua_hin/all/6570",
            "urls": [
              {
