      {
        "h_title": "Chalelarn Hotel",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Hua Hin",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Rising from a corner of the main tourist area in a barrage of tinted glass and light violet paint, the Chalelarn Hotel has raised the bar among Hua Hin’s midrange hotels. All seven storeys are done in a sometimes over-the-top traditional Thai theme that relies heavily on polished dark wood, woven bamboo, colourful silk, old-style Thai carvings, glittering elephants and plenty of... Read our full review of Chalelarn Hotel including room rates and direct contact details.",
