        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Halfway between Soi 51 and the central tourist area, Hua Hin Place left us thinking that we’ll be calling for a room next time we’re in town. A very pleasant staff member was quick to welcome us to a breezy ground-floor lobby that’s filled with wind chimes, sofas, tables, books and shared computers. Rooms have a subtle but charming Thai sea-cottage theme that includes wicker furniture,... Read our full review of Hua Hin Place Guesthouse including room rates and direct contact details.",
