        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "The intimate and family-run Sunshine Hotel has developed one of the best reputations on Soi 67 thanks to its consistently clean rooms and cheerful staff. It’s very much a guesthouse; we’re not sure why they’ve begun calling the place a hotel. Whatever the label, rooms are comfortable with more effort put into keeping the place clean rather than creating a trendy image. Expect... Read our full review of Sunshine Hotel including room rates and direct contact details.",
