        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "The long-running Leng now calls itself a “hotel guesthouse” (it used to be just a guesthouse), making us wonder why Soi 67’s guesthouse owners seem to be having an identity crisis. This spot is larger than some of the other places on this soi, giving it a more reasonable claim to the title of hotel, but it’s still a fairly cosy family-run spot. Passing through a cluttered lobby and up... Read our full review of Leng Hotel including room rates and direct contact details.",
